1
00:00:08,311 --> 00:00:13,187
There is no plan to choose. The bill is
built from what you are actually using.

2
00:00:13,639 --> 00:00:19,165
The people who work here, at
one price each, whatever they do.

3
00:00:19,617 --> 00:00:24,679
Then each workspace, priced for
what it switched on and nothing else.

4
00:00:25,132 --> 00:00:30,956
And the things bought once for the whole
company, which is why they are not charged

5
00:00:30,956 --> 00:00:31,587
per site.

6
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:36,730
Switch something on and the number
moves. Nothing here is a phone call.

7
00:00:37,183 --> 00:00:41,409
Next: the paperwork between a
company and the people who work for it.

